# ============================================================
# THIS FILE IS NOT DEPLOYED AND HAS NO EFFECT.
#
# The live server config is  public/.htaccess  — that is the one
# copied into dist/ and uploaded to the web root by the FTP workflow.
# Edit that file, not this one.
#
# History: this used to hold the gzip/caching/MIME rules, with a header
# telling you to paste it into hPanel by hand. That never happened, and it
# could not work anyway — the deploy uploads dist/ straight to the web root,
# so a hand-placed .htaccess there gets overwritten on the next push. Those
# rules now live in public/.htaccess and ship with every deploy.
#
# Kept as a signpost so nobody re-adds rules here and wonders why the live
# site ignores them.
# ============================================================
